From 2325c5e131e1ecf8c7b94b9da7222207b076c632 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:00:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] D1 and D2 final round: dotted not-yet marks, Start B2 in D1,
 shell and wording

- One dotted mark for every not-yet/unknown state, with tokens in the D1 stylesheet
- Start (B2) moved into the D1 engine; D1 cover component, D2 screen 1 and the study render it
- Boarding pass: destination on a dotted underline, 15% larger on desktop; card 24px above the footer
- Disclaimer line in every footer; band cap for an unknown Non-negotiable
- Compact phone headers, desktop header with inline links and More, neutral rail, reading pages without a next bar
- Move Plan renamed to Your travel folder; nav links fixed to the real file names

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R1t1sqzMbnrFHTa3XNSAQK
